        "url": "/api/v2/version/26/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "すの　おくふかくに　タマゴを　うむ。\nクイタランに　おそわれると　おおきな\nアゴで　かみついて　はんげき。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "굴속 깊은 곳에 알을 낳는다.\n앤티골에게 공격받으면 커다란\n턱으로 물어서 반격한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在巢穴的深處產卵。\n受到熔蟻獸的襲擊時會用\n大大的顎部咬住對方進行反擊。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il dépose ses Œufs tout au fond de son terrier.\nLorsqu’un Aflamanoir l’attaque, il se défend\nà l’aide de ses mandibules.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es legt seine Eier im hintersten Winkel des Nests.\nWenn es von Furnifraß bedroht wird, wehrt es\nsich mit seinen kräftigen Kiefern.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Deposita sus huevos en la parte más profunda\ndel nido. Si un Heatmor lo ataca, se defiende\nmordiéndolo con sus enormes mandíbulas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Depone le Uova nei recessi più interni del suo\nnido. Se un Heatmor lo attacca, si difende\nmordendolo con le grandi mandibole.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "They lay their eggs deep inside their nests.\nWhen attacked by Heatmor, they retaliate\nusing their massive mandibles.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
